&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Zscaler (NASDAQ: ZS) accelerates digital transformation so customers can be more agile, efficient, resilient, and secure. The Zscaler Zero Trust Exchange™️ platform protects thousands of customers from cyberattacks and data loss by securely connecting users, devices, and applications in any location. Distributed across 160+ public exchanges globally and thousands of private exchanges at the edge, the SASE-based Zero Trust Exchange is the world’s largest in-line cloud security platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the future of work is Human + AI and are building an AI-native enterprise where human potential is amplified by machine intelligence to solve the world’s hardest security challenges. Driven by deep customer obsession, we are committed to the mission, outcome, and to each other. We bring these commitments to life through three core behaviors: ownership and collaboration, trust through outcomes and impact, and a challenge culture with ongoing feedback. Ready to make an impact at the company pioneering security transformation in the AI era? Join us at Zscaler.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a high-caliber &lt;strong&gt;Director, P&amp;amp;C Communications &amp;amp; Cultural Narrative&lt;/strong&gt; to join our People &amp;amp; Culture team at our Santa Clara headquarters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will lead an integrated P&amp;amp;C Communications and Creative team while serving as a strategic thought partner, executive communications leader, and change narrative strategist. You will shape how Zscaler’s people strategy, culture, and organizational priorities are translated into clear, compelling narratives across employee and candidate experiences. Partnering directly with senior P&amp;amp;C executives and leadership, you will help shape bold visions and complex organizational shifts into clear, inspiring, and transparent employee and external communications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You operate with the strategic foresight of an executive advisor—understanding the downstream cause and effect of organizational messaging, calibrating tone to build trust, and fostering a strong sense of company culture across our global enterprise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a &quot;player-coach&quot;—someone who can operate at the highest level of strategic advisory while remaining deeply involved in the daily craft of storytelling, messaging, and content creation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires a balanced approach: you will operate as a high-level strategic architect, while simultaneously rolling up your sleeves to ensure the quality and execution of our narrative and creative output.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Messaging &amp;amp; Strategic Advisory:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as a trusted advisor to senior P&amp;amp;C leaders, coaching on tone calibration and crafting high-impact executive communications, all-hands presentations, leadership briefs, and organizational updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cause-and-Effect Impact Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Evaluate major People &amp;amp; Culture initiatives (such as performance evolutions, organizational shifts, and policy updates) to anticipate employee sentiment, assess downstream impact, and proactively address risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Change Communications Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Shape the narrative, sequencing, audience messaging, channels, leader communications, and manager communication tools for complex organizational changes, partnering with program and change leads to support readiness and reinforcement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cultural Narrative, Talent Storytelling &amp;amp; Creative:&lt;/strong&gt; Shape and steward a cohesive cultural narrative that connects Zscaler’s people strategy, Ways of Working, and employee experience. Lead how that story comes to life across employee and candidate touchpoints through communications, visual design, video, and multimedia, partnering with Talent Acquisition, Corporate Communications, and Marketing to ensure alignment with Zscaler’s broader brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Corporate Communications, Marketing, and Executive Leadership to align internal and external messaging, amplifying Zscaler&#39;s workplace culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measurement &amp;amp; Feedback:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish feedback mechanisms to gauge communication effectiveness, sentiment, and message retention, continuously refining strategies based on insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are resilient and adaptable.&lt;/strong&gt; You view change as an opportunity and setbacks as temporary. You maintain composure and focus in high-pressure situations, guiding yourself and your team through complexity with a steady, positive hand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You lead with integrity.&lt;/strong&gt; You do the right thing, even when it’s hard. You hold yourself and others to a high standard of accountability and build trust by matching your words with consistent, transparent action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are a pragmatic builder.&lt;/strong&gt; You are obsessed with creating, iterating, and shipping. You aren&#39;t afraid to roll up your sleeves and build the first version yourself, balancing the drive for technical excellence with the need to deliver value to users quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are a positive force.&lt;/strong&gt; You approach hard problems with constructive energy and a &#39;can-do&#39; spirit that is contagious, inspiring your team to stay focused on the solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You operate with urgency.&lt;/strong&gt; You understand that in a high-growth environment, speed and quality are not mutually exclusive. You have a relentless focus on execution and a bias for action, delivering high-impact results quickly to win for the customer and the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated curiosity and active exploration of AI tools, with a proven history of integrating new technologies to enhance daily workflows and augment problem-solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &quot;player-coach&quot; mindset: You are just as comfortable facilitating strategic alignment with C-suite executives as you are drafting internal communications, reviewing creative assets, and shaping hands-on day-to-day messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of progressive, high-impact experience across a broad breadth of communications disciplines—specifically including executive communications, corporate communications, and Employer Brand/Talent PR—with a proven track record of supporting organizational change in a fast-paced global environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading communications strategy within a hyper-growth or highly complex global organization where you have successfully navigated matrixed leadership structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated editorial judgment and the ability to constructively challenge and influence senior leaders, including recommending when a message, timing, channel, or approach should change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading multidisciplinary communications, creative, and/or talent brand teams, with the ability to set direction, develop talent, and maintain a high bar for quality and impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of change dynamics, organizational psychology, and messaging risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ownership mindset with high diplomatic acumen, empathy, and judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience bridging corporate exec communications with high-stake impact, public affairs, or campaign strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of developing enablement tools and briefing guides for frontline managers during periods of rapid growth or business transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to combine strong written narratives with compelling visual messaging for executive presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#onsite #LI-JL5&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Zscaler’s salary ranges are benchmarked and are determined by role and level. The range displayed on each job posting reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire salaries for the position across all US locations and could be higher or lower based on a multitude of factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary range listed for this full-time position excludes commission/ bonus/ equity (if applicable) + benefits.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$175,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$250,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At Zscaler, we are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve and the customers we work with. We foster an inclusive environment that values all backgrounds and perspectives, emphasizing collaboration and belonging. Join us in our mission to make doing business seamless and secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Benefits program is one of the most important ways we support our employees. Zscaler proudly offers comprehensive and inclusive benefits to meet the diverse needs of our employees and their families throughout their life stages, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off plans for vacation and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office perks, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Learn more about Zscaler&#39;s hybrid working model and benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zscaler.com/candidate-resource-hub&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this role, you adhere to applicable laws, regulations, and Zscaler policies, including those related to security and privacy standards and guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing equal employment opportunities to all individuals. We strive to create a workplace where employees are treated with respect and have the chance to succeed. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy or related medical conditions), age, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, genetic information, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. &lt;em&gt;See more information by clicking on the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights: Workplace Discrimination is Illegal &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;link.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler complies with all applicable federal, state, and local pay transparency rules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing reasonable support (called accommodations or adjustments) in our recruiting processes for candidates who are differently abled, have long term conditions, mental health conditions or sincerely held religious beliefs, or who are neurodivergent or require pregnancy-related support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
